node_modules/
.env
.env.local
*.tsbuildinfo
src/standards/generated/

# A build's artefacts are tracked on purpose — E9 designed the tree so §34
# global corrections, coverage diffs and reissue passes run as scripts over it,
# and a diff of act_map.json between two runs is worth reading.
#
# What is NOT tracked: the bundle the operator dropped in, the media the
# platform returned, and the rendered HTML. All three are large, all three are
# reproducible, and none of them is the record.
builds/*/inbox/
builds/*/media/
builds/*/deliveries/
